# graysentinel.rules

Custom Suricata IDS rules developed during GraySentinel Cyber Range training.

## Detections Covered

- ICMP reconnaissance
- ICMP data transfer attempts
- Nmap SYN scans
- Port scanning
- SMB enumeration
- Web directory brute forcing
- HTTP data exfiltration
- Executable downloads
- PowerShell activity
- DNS tunneling indicators
- SMB exploitation attempts
- SSH brute force
- RDP brute force
- IP fragmentation
- Web scanning tools

## Logs Generated

Suricata outputs:

- fast.log
- eve.json
- stats.log

## Purpose

These rules were created for defensive monitoring,
IDS tuning, threat hunting, and incident response practice
inside the GraySentinel cybersecurity laboratory.
